        },
        {
          "text": "“Andika amazina y’abakomoka mu nzu kwa Gerishoni hamwe n’imiryango y’Abagerishoni bose bakomoka kuri Lewi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.22",
